# JetBrains Fleet's dark palette, retuned for red-green color vision deficiency.
#
# The red slot is orange and the green slot is blue, on purpose: deuteranopia and
# protanopia collapse the red-green axis, so the two colors that most often carry
# opposed meanings are placed at opposite ends of the blue-yellow axis instead.
# Every pair of text colors from different hue families stays at least 15 dE76
# apart after Vienot dichromat simulation, and every one clears 4.5:1 on the
# background. Slots 0 and 8 are chrome (borders, dim fills) and never text.

background = #181818
foreground = #d6d6dd

cursor-color = #639bfb
cursor-text = #181818

selection-background = #163761
selection-foreground = #d6d6dd

